# Arming without the applied-prefix tracker: the advance passes the activation's
# own append still in flight, the snapshot captures that coverage, and the append
# then lands below it.
MODULE: SnapshotHonestNoOwnTracker
TARGET: SnapshotHonest
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: the activation arms while one of its own appends is allocated and not yet applied
PERTURBS: LiveAdvance

--- FIND
    /\ rp[a] >= seenU[a]
    /\ \A o \in inflight : author[o] # a
--- REPLACE
    /\ rp[a] >= seenU[a]
\* MUTATION: own appends in flight are not waited for.
--- END